<title>JAPAN: Japan Feb refinery operating rate at 90.1 pct.</title>
<headline>Japan Feb refinery operating rate at 90.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The utilisation rate of Japanese oil refineries was at 90.1 percent in February, up from 88.6 percent in the same month a year earlier, and up from 89.3 percent in January, the trade ministry said on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
